  "reply": "根据文档《JRS-EAP-Asia_06JAN2023_Public.pdf》中“Bureau Objective 2.2 Risk Considerations”部分的陈述，不采取行动应对气候变化（inaction）的潜在后果包括：\n\n1. **对经济、安全、自然资源和公共健康造成灾难性损害**：文档指出，“Without action, rapidly rising temperatures pose an acute danger and have the potential to cause catastrophic damage to the economy, security, natural resources, and public health of the United States, our allies, and partner countries.”\n\n2. **加剧社会和经济不平等**：文档提到，“Failing to address the climate crisis will exacerbate many of the complex social and economic inequalities that currently exist in the region where action to mitigate its adverse impacts is either limited or stymied due to poor governance, a lack of resources/capacity, and corruption.”\n\n3. **威胁国家安全并危及几乎所有领域的发展成果**：文档明确写道，“Inaction has grave consequences globally as it will continue to threaten national security and jeopardize development gains in nearly every sector.”\n\n这些后果均来自文档第18–20页的原文，强调了不采取行动将带来的严重且广泛的负面影响。",
